# Action & Interaction Documentation - Cooperative Labeling Platform

This document describes the complete behavior of the Cooperative Labeling Platform through user actions and system reactions. It serves as a map of the entire system's functionality and cross-role interactions.

---

## 1. USER TYPES

| Role | Access Level | Key Capabilities | Restricted Areas |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Guest** (Non-connected) | Public Pages | Browse labels, companies, news, and multimedia. Use global search and filters. | Profile, Library, Hub, Apply, Admin. |
| **Normal User** | Personal Features | Save articles to library, post comments, manage personal profile. | Org Hub (unless company owner), Admin. |
| **Professional User** | Organization Hub | Submit label applications, manage documents, view cert history, embed badges. | Admin Dashboard. |
| **Administrator** | Full Control | Moderate applications, manage labels/companies, system configuration, ads/news. | None. |

---

## 2. COMPLETE PAGE LIST

### Public Access
- **Home (`/`)**: Central landing showing featured labels, news ticker, and platform value proposition.
- **Protocoles/Labels (`/labels`)**: Directory of available certification protocols. Filterable by sector.
- **Détail Protocole (`/labels/:id`)**: Detailed criteria and requirements for a specific label.
- **Répertoire/Directory (`/directory`)**: Searchable list of certified organizations with sector/region filters.
- **Profil Entreprise (`/directory/:id`)**: Public profile of a company showing its certification status and scores.
- **Actualités/News (`/news`)**: List of articles and sector analyses.
- **Kiosque (`/kiosk`)**: Access to monthly reviews and PDF reports.
- **Multimédia (`/multimedia`)**: Video masterclasses and expert interviews.
- **Tarifs/Pricing (`/pricing`)**: Subscription plans for organizations.

### Private (Authenticated)
- **Profil (`/profile`)**: Personal settings and account management.
- **Ma Bibliothèque (`/library`)**: Collection of saved news articles.
- **Org Hub (`/org-hub`)**: Dashboard for organization owners to track their status.
- **Mes Candidatures (`/org-hub/applications`)**: List of all draft, pending, and past label applications.
- **Historique (`/org-hub/history`)**: Timeline of all certifications, PDF downloads, and renewal triggers.
- **Postuler (`/apply/:id`)**: Multi-step application interface for a specific label.

### Admin Dashboard (`/admin`)
- **Vue d'ensemble**: Global stats and expiry vigilance widget.
- **Gestion Labels**: Create/Edit/Delete certification protocols.
- **Gestion Entreprises**: Manual management of company records and statuses.
- **Critères**: Management of questions and criteria for each label.
- **Flash Infos**: Real-time management of the breaking news ticker.
- **Candidatures**: Reviewing queued applications, approving/rejecting, and auditor logic.

---

## 3. UI ELEMENTS & FUNCTIONS

| Component | Function | System Process Triggered |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Global Search Bar** | Search labels/companies across the site. | Dynamic filtering of displayed content. |
| **News Ticker** | Scrolling critical information at the top. | Real-time broadcast from Admin panel. |
| **Notification Bell** | View system alerts (applications, comments). | Triggers unread count reset on click. |
| **Filtre Secteur/Région** | Narrow down directory or news results. | Updates UI list via API query parameters. |
| **Bouton "Postuler"** | Initiate a label application. | Creates a 'draft' application in DB for the Org. |
| **Zone de Chat (Apply)** | Direct messaging between Org and Admin. | Creates [Message](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/components/chat/ChatPanel.tsx#24-34) entity; triggers notifications. |
| **Widget Vigilance** | Monitor expiring certifications (Admin). | manual check triggers expiry notifications. |
| **Digital Badge Embed** | Copy HTML for company badges. | Fetches dynamic SVG badge data via API. |

---

## 4. USER ACTIONS & PROCESSES

### Action: Submit Application
- **Location**: `/apply/:id` -> "Soumettre la candidature"
- **Interaction**: User fills criteria, uploads proofs, and clicks submit.
- **Immediate Response**: Toast notification; Status changes from `draft` to `pending`.
- **Backend Process**: [Application](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/pages/admin/ApplicationReviewPage.tsx#76-90) status updated; [Notification](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/components/notifications/NotificationBell.tsx#21-204) created for Admin.
- **Data Modified**: [Application](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/pages/admin/ApplicationReviewPage.tsx#76-90) status, `updatedAt`.

### Action: Approved by Admin
- **Location**: `/admin/applications/:id` -> "Approuver"
- **Interaction**: Admin reviews documents and clicks Approve.
- **Immediate Response**: Application disappears from pending queue.
- **Backend Process**: Status -> `approved`; Company status -> `certified`; PDF Certificate generated; Notification sent to Org.
- **Data Created**: [Notification](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/components/notifications/NotificationBell.tsx#21-204), PDF file on disk, `certificateUrl` in App.

### Action: Initiate Renewal
- **Location**: `/org-hub/history` -> "Renouveler"
- **Interaction**: User clicks renewal button on an expiring certificate.
- **Immediate Response**: Redirects to a new pre-filled application form.
- **Backend Process**: Creates a new [Draft](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/pages/ApplyPage.tsx#79-94) application linked via `renewedFrom`.
- **Data Created**: New [Application](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/pages/admin/ApplicationReviewPage.tsx#76-90) document.

---

## 5. ACTION CONSEQUENCES

| User Action | Org Dashboard Result | Admin Dashboard Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Posts Comment** | Comment appears under article; "My Activity" updated. | Appears in moderation queue for review/deletion. |
| **Uploads Document** | Document shows as "Uploaded" in step. | Admin sees "New Document" in the review panel. |
| **Sends Message** | Message appears in chat history. | Admin receives notification; Message appears in Review panel. |
| **Subscription Paid**| Status upgraded; Premium content unlocked. | Revenue logged in Subscription Admin panel. |

---

## 6. CROSS-DASHBOARD EFFECTS (CHAINS)

### Certification Workflow
1. **Prospective Org**: Submits application (`pending`).
2. **System**: Generates notification for Admin.
3. **Admin**: Reads notification -> Opens Review Page.
4. **Admin**: Sends message asking for clarification.
5. **System**: Notifies Org of a new message.
6. **Org**: Responds and uploads missing document.
7. **Admin**: Reviews final proof -> Clicks **Approve**.
8. **System**: Updates Company to `certified` -> Generates PDF -> Notifies Org.
9. **Final Result**: Org sees Certificate in History; Public Badge appears on their profile.

---

## 7. DASHBOARD STRUCTURES

### Organization Dashboard (`/org-hub`)
- **Overview**: Active certification status, quick links to history/apps.
- **Applications**: Tabular view of all progress (Draft/Pending/Archived).
- **History**: Vertical timeline of every certificate ever earned.
- **Tools**: Digital Badge generator, Document vault.

### Admin Dashboard (`/admin`)
- **Vigilance**: Countdown of certifications expiring in 60/30/7 days.
- **Content Engine**: Forms for News articles, Kiosk reports, and Multimedia.
- **Workflow**: Queued applications with real-time audit tools.
- **Configuration**: Settings for breaking news ticker and ad banners.

---

## 8. NOTIFICATION SYSTEM

- **Trigger Actions**: Status change, New Message, New Application, Expiry Reminder (60d, 30d, 7d).
- **Recipients**: Targeted (Org Owner) or Role-based (All Admins).
- **Delivery**: Real-time via UI Bell (Websocket/Polling) and future Email integration.
- **Types**: `info`, `success`, `warning` (expiry), [error](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/backend/src/middleware/errorHandler.ts#20-39).

---

## 9. MESSAGING SYSTEM

- **Context**: Conversations are tied to specific [Application](file:///c:/Users/eser/Documents/Money%20making%20projects/label/Project/frontend/src/pages/admin/ApplicationReviewPage.tsx#76-90) IDs.
- **Participants**: Company Owner <-> Admin Team.
- **States**: Every message is persisted with `senderId`, `content`, and `timestamp`.
- **Visibility**: Shared across all Admins for continuity.

---

